=== [REVIEWER_THOUGHT] ===
The code is well-structured and adheres to the decoupling principles. The core conversion logic is encapsulated in pure functions that accept numeric inputs and return numeric outputs. Input validation is handled by a private helper function `_validate_input`, ensuring that business logic remains clean. There is no I/O (input/output) mixed with the conversion logic; the CLI harness is represented only by a mapping dictionary (`CONVERSION_MAP`), which allows for easy integration into a separate CLI script without violating separation of concerns. The code is highly testable.

